<https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/graph/knowledge/talks-ted-processing-units> {
  ex:ted-processing-step a cd:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "What does one processing step do?"@en ; cd:hasDefinition ex:ted-processing-step-definition ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-processing-step-definition a cd:Definition ; cd:body "A processing step accepts input data, performs a defined task and produces output data. Parameters configure the transformation. Input and output are distinct from the algorithm that implements the task. Describing that interface lets a person or another tool determine what can be supplied and what the result means. The schematic is conceptual, not a running operation or a claim that all processing has exactly one input and one output."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-composable-steps a cd:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "An output becomes the next input"@en ; cd:hasDefinition ex:ted-composable-steps-definition ; skos:related ex:cogniflow-processing-pipeline ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-composable-steps-definition a cd:Definition ; cd:body "A pipeline explicitly connects specialized processing steps. Each step has a defined task; a produced result can supply a following step's input only when their interface contracts are compatible. Matching file extensions or port names alone is insufficient: meaning, data types, structure, units and applicable constraints must agree, or an explicit conversion is needed. The illustrated TED excerpt detects features in EICs, jointly fits compatible features into components, and selects marker components. It does not claim to show the whole pipeline or to replace its import and external calibration steps."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-processing-unit a cd:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "Interfaces first: the ProcessingUnit"@en ; cd:hasDefinition ex:ted-processing-unit-definition ; skos:related ex:cogniflow-domain-specifications ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-processing-unit-definition a cd:Definition ; cd:body "In the CogniFlow workshop model, ProcessingUnit is the reusable processing abstraction. It exposes Port attributes, with PortRole values Input, Output and Parameter. ProcessingStep is an atomic specialization; ProcessingPipeline is a composite specialization, composed through PipelineNodes whose RunTarget identifies the ProcessingUnit being run. Both can expose the same kind of interface. Describe port meaning using shared, defined vocabulary, together with data type, structure, units, cardinality and validity constraints where relevant. The input contract describes what is required; the output contract describes what is produced. A compatible output can be connected to a subsequent input. First explain this public contract, then the algorithm, parameters, software version and execution provenance behind it. This is an explanatory order, not an exemption from documenting implementation or a claim that standardized ports alone make processing FAIR or reproducible. The diagram's arrows depict data entering and leaving a unit; hasPort and PortRole are the corresponding semantic structure, not execution-order edges."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .

  ex:ted-step-points a cd:Interpretation ; cd:body "A defined transformation connects input and output."@en ; cd:hasKeyPoint ex:ted-step-p1, ex:ted-step-p2, ex:ted-step-p3 ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-step-p1 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 1 ; cd:body "**Input:** the data a step receives"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-step-p2 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 2 ; cd:body "**Process:** one defined task transforms the data"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-step-p3 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 3 ; cd:body "**Output:** the result the step produces"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-points a cd:Interpretation ; cd:body "Specialized steps compose through compatible interfaces."@en ; cd:hasKeyPoint ex:ted-chain-p1, ex:ted-chain-p2, ex:ted-chain-p3 ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-p1 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 1 ; cd:body "**Each step:** one defined task"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-p2 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 2 ; cd:body "**Connect:** an output supplies a following input"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-p3 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 3 ; cd:body "==Compatible meaning, not just matching file names=="@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-points a cd:Interpretation ; cd:body "Standardize the public contract, then describe its implementation."@en ; cd:hasKeyPoint ex:ted-unit-p1, ex:ted-unit-p2, ex:ted-unit-p3 ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-p1 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 1 ; cd:body "**First:** shared input/output meaning, types, structure and units"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-p2 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 2 ; cd:body "**Ports:** Input, Output and Parameter"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-p3 a cd:KeyPoint ; cd:position 3 ; cd:body "**Then:** algorithm, parameters, version and execution provenance"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
}
<https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/graph/sources/talks-ted-processing-units> {
  ex:ted-source-processing-unit a cd:Source ; dct:title "CogniFlow workshop: ProcessingUnit, Port roles and pipeline composition" ; dct:creator "Gerrit Renner" ; dct:identifier "cogniflow_workshop.html#cf-concept-domain-diagram" ; dct:hasVersion "sha256:b188e0a56a92d6872e1d013b82260ac97cacbd84d1ee8a866fb37526618c0725" ; dct:description "Supplied workshop diagram: ProcessingUnit; Port; PortRole with Input, Output and Parameter; ProcessingStep and ProcessingPipeline as specializations; PipelineNode and runs targeting a ProcessingUnit. Teaching adaptation aligns with existing cogniflow-domain-specifications.trig and cogniflow-processing-pipeline.trig. No historical core hasAttribute syntax is imported as a new canonical ontology contract."@en ; cd:supportsResource ex:ted-processing-step-definition, ex:ted-composable-steps-definition, ex:ted-processing-unit-definition ; cd:authoredResource true .
}
<https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/graph/diagrams/talks-ted-processing-units> {
  ex:ted-step-flow a cd:FlowDiagram ; skos:prefLabel "Input, process and output"@en ; cd:body "A conceptual processing step. Parameters configure its task; multiple inputs or outputs are possible."@en ; cd:hasDiagramNode ex:ted-abstract-input, ex:ted-abstract-process, ex:ted-abstract-output ; cd:hasDiagramEdge ex:ted-abstract-edge1, ex:ted-abstract-edge2 ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-abstract-input a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 1 ; skos:prefLabel "Input"@en ; cd:body "Data before the step"@en ; cd:visualMotif "data-import" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-processing-step ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-abstract-process a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 2 ; skos:prefLabel "Process"@en ; cd:body "Perform a defined task"@en ; cd:visualMotif "hands-on" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-processing-step ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-abstract-output a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 3 ; skos:prefLabel "Output"@en ; cd:body "Data after the step"@en ; cd:visualMotif "statistics" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-processing-step ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-abstract-edge1 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 1 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-abstract-input ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-abstract-process ; skos:prefLabel "receives"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-abstract-edge2 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 2 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-abstract-process ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-abstract-output ; skos:prefLabel "produces"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .

  ex:ted-chain-flow a cd:FlowDiagram ; skos:prefLabel "Specialized steps connected by results"@en ; cd:body "Excerpt of the TED pipeline: each output is the following input. Import and external calibration remain part of the full workflow."@en ; cd:hasDiagramNode ex:ted-chain-peaks, ex:ted-chain-components, ex:ted-chain-markers ; cd:hasDiagramEdge ex:ted-chain-edge1, ex:ted-chain-edge2 ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-peaks a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 1 ; skos:prefLabel "Find peaks"@en ; cd:body "IN: EICs\nTASK: detect peaks\nOUT: features"@en ; cd:visualMotif "peak-search" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-qpeaks ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-components a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 2 ; skos:prefLabel "Form components"@en ; cd:body "IN: features\nTASK: joint fitting\nOUT: components"@en ; cd:visualMotif "shared-peak-shape" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-peak-components ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-markers a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 3 ; skos:prefLabel "Select markers"@en ; cd:body "IN: components\nTASK: select markers\nOUT: marker components"@en ; cd:visualMotif "marker-selection" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-polymer-markers ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-edge1 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 1 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-chain-peaks ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-chain-components ; skos:prefLabel "features"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-chain-edge2 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 2 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-chain-components ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-chain-markers ; skos:prefLabel "components"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .

  ex:ted-unit-flow a cd:FlowDiagram ; skos:prefLabel "A ProcessingUnit exposes a standardized interface"@en ; cd:body "ProcessingUnit hasPort Port; each Port has a role. A ProcessingStep is atomic; a ProcessingPipeline is composite. Both expose the same interface pattern."@en ; cd:hasDiagramNode ex:ted-unit-input, ex:ted-unit-process, ex:ted-unit-output ; cd:hasDiagramEdge ex:ted-unit-edge1, ex:ted-unit-edge2 ; cd:hasSource ex:ted-source-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-input a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 1 ; skos:prefLabel "Input port"@en ; cd:body "Required meaning\nType · structure · units"@en ; cd:visualMotif "data-import" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-process a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 2 ; skos:prefLabel "ProcessingUnit"@en ; cd:body "Reusable interface\nAtomic step or pipeline"@en ; cd:visualMotif "hands-on" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:cogniflow-domain-specifications ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-output a cd:DiagramNode ; cd:position 3 ; skos:prefLabel "Output port"@en ; cd:body "Produced meaning\nType · structure · units"@en ; cd:visualMotif "statistics" ; cd:visualMotifRole "highlight" ; dct:references ex:ted-processing-unit ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-edge1 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 1 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-unit-input ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-unit-process ; skos:prefLabel "input data"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:ted-unit-edge2 a cd:DiagramEdge ; cd:position 2 ; cd:sourceNode ex:ted-unit-process ; cd:targetNode ex:ted-unit-output ; skos:prefLabel "output data"@en ; cd:authoredResource true .
}
